  "solution": {
    "text": "BeCl<sub>2</sub> exists as (BeCl<sub>2</sub>)n polymeric chain in solid form, while BeCl<sub>2</sub> exists as dimer in vapour phase because <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> has vacant orbital and it is electron deficient.<br />In vapour state<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ae59ba3f-a4bb-46e7-b8b3-fab14a28bb06-image19.png\" /><br />In solid state<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/19d6083f-2a3d-4ba2-b487-28f0c48d027b-image20.png\" />",
